  // ── Canon Mallory, the Close's critic, and the Children of the Close ────────────────────────────────────────────
  Person mallory "Canon Mallory" at canon_study {
    Role "the minster's precentor, and the Close's critic". Ancestry human. Peaceable. Pronouns he. Manner compassionate.
    Greets "Canon Mallory is a plump pink clergyman with a pipe, a harpsichord and a kind, worried face. He rises when you come in, which nobody else in Pentrice does.".
    Profession priest.
    Offers healing "a dressing, and a psalm said over it" for 2 coin.
  }
  Topic mallory_taste with mallory "Ask Canon Mallory what a play is for" when true once {
    Says "'Ah.' The Canon knocks out his pipe on the leg of the harpsichord, which he plainly allows nobody else to do. 'Home better. That is all I ask of it. Not preached at; I have the pulpit for that, and, well, they do not come.' He refills the pipe. 'A kindness done, a pride brought low, a quarrel made up, and nobody the worse. They go home kinder for a week. A week, mind. I would take a week.' He lights it. 'Filth I will not have. Nor the dead mocked, who cannot answer. Beyond that I find I am very easily pleased,' he adds, in the voice of a man confessing to a vice.".
    On discuss { Assert knows(actor, taste_mallory). }
  }
  Topic mallory_voice with mallory "Ask Canon Mallory how the choir keeps a breaking voice through a season" when knows(actor, kit_fear) or knows(actor, ned_wants) once {
    Says "'Ah,' says the Canon, and sits down at the harpsichord and plays a note, and then a lower one. 'Honey and horehound, the horehound bruised and the honey stirred in off the boil. But that is not the trick.' He plays the first note again. 'The trick is to sing under the voice, not over it. A breaking voice breaks reaching up. Let every line come down to you, as if you were tired; never go up after the top of it.' He closes the lid. 'It will hold a night, done so. A season, perhaps. Not two.' He sighs. 'Ned Cherry's will go before the year is out, and then I shall lose him.'".
    On discuss { Assert knows(actor, mallory_trick). }
  }
  Discovery mallory_trick "Canon Mallory's way with a breaking voice: honey and horehound, the horehound bruised and the honey stirred in off the boil; and sing under the voice, letting every line come down, never reaching up after the top of it." { Known by mallory. }

