    Time 1 minute.
    On success { Retract warned(gervase, actor). Assert tolerates(gervase, actor). Assert received(actor). Assert gervaseShaken(gervase). }
    Result "The sword does not come down; it stops, which is worse to watch. 'Who told you that,' says Sir Gervase. It is not a question. You tell him: her brother, from the north, about their mother's will; the letter in the work-box; the snow. He hears it standing, with the point of the sword on his own floor, and then he lets it fall, and it rings on the stone, and he sits down where he stands, like a man who has walked a long way and is not sure it was the right road. 'Sit,' he says, at last. 'Sit, then.'".
  }
  Action ask_who_waits(actor: group, site: place) "Put your hands where he can see them, and ask him whom he sits up for" {
