  Observe hut_fever at hut when not childTreated(party) "The little girl in the bed is burning; you can feel it from the door. Her mother sits by her with a wet cloth, and does not look round.".
  Observe hut_cost at hut when not childTreated(party) and following(ottery, party) and beforeCollege() "Ottery has his coat half off already. Then he stops, and looks at you. 'An hour,' he says. 'That's the College, by the drove road. They sit at noon and they'll not wait.' He looks at the child. 'It's your character they want at Orm, not mine. You choose.'".
