  Event housebook_letter near housebook when keeps(housebook, jonquil_letter) and not housebookOffended(housebook) "The letter goes out of your hand and lies on the scrubbed table, and for a long time nothing happens. Then the seal breaks by itself. The kitchen is quiet while the house reads. When the voice comes again it is not sharp at all. 'He says I don't have to,' says the Housebook. 'He says he'd like me to.' The kettle ticks as it cools. 'He says his mother's hand is the last thing he wants to see.' The kettle stops. 'Well. He always did eat the honey out of everything.' Another pause, and the voice gathers itself. 'I'll go home. For a while. Wake, and be read by him, while he lives. And then I'll sleep.' She sounds surprised at herself. 'So I'll vote for the Sleep by leave, God help me. And a door that can be used, under licence, by them that have somewhere to go.'" then {
