  Objective pm_find_obj when knows(party, pm_claim) and not pm_fund_home(party) "The Penny Mutual of Salt Lane has lost its fund to a treasurer it has voted to forgive. Nine members are on the NEXT board, and no one will be buried or physicked until the fund is home.".
